# Findings — two defects in `docs/TASK_TYPES.md`

Produced 2026-10-11 by the workflow-design session for run `20261011-agent-memory-graph`, from the blind
checklist review of that design. The table is EJ's, so nothing here was edited: these are recorded, and the
design runs around them (Q5 and Q6 in `design.md`). The design gate parses `docs/TASK_TYPES.md` directly, so a
change there moves every design — which is why this is a finding and not a fix.

